        "created_at": "2013-03-15T00:26:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>by villian card do you mean just a card that says \"The Ennead\" or do you mean the villain set up card? The ennead is not just one villain, its several, so their is no single card (like Baron Blades that says Terralunar Impulsion Beam Inventor on one side and Vengeful Mad scientist on the other with just artwork) but rather all the members of the Ennead (shu, atum, geb ect) whom have powers upon them</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>the setup card is the card full of text that tells you how to play the villain - if thats missing, then yes, its definatly missing :p</p>",
